    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Stalwart and steadfast, paladins that walk the path of protection are ardent defenders of the Light and all that it touches, and are rejuvenated by it's radiance in return. So dedicated they are to their cause that they consecrate the very ground upon which they battle corruption.</p><h2>Path of Protection Spells</h2><table><tbody><tr><td data-colwidth=\"58\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Paladin Level</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Spells</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"58\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3rd</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.gvdA9nPuWLck4tBl]{Sanctuary}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.jZ6JNykRtdQ90MOo]{Shield of Faith}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"58\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5th</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.7UwUjJ6owIQkEPrs]{Branding Smite}, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.spells.Item.FHkcj2GWnCapS0z4]{Guardian of the King}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"58\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">9th</p></td><td><p>Aura of Vitality, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.spells.Item.GcB9x6uwSw0FJUT8]{Blinding Light}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"58\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">13th</p></td><td><p>Aura of Purity, Death Ward</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"58\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">17th</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.SLxA9QhrggTz0taU]{Hallow}, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.spells.Item.jOV5x4F2CaXfRZnR]{Light of the Protector}</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
